    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-621545116166783975 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/thephotostick/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=620523353060409955&sectionId=621545116166783975)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gggtDdkXDNb_text","label":"gggtDdkXDNb_text","default":"<p>Frequently asked questions</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCaflpu5Mi_text","label":"ggCaflpu5Mi_text","default":"<p>Have questions? We’re here to help</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg90ebmzGqD_childItem_0","label":"gg90ebmzGqD_childItem_0","default":"<p>Is ThePhotoStick® Omni X easy to use?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg90ebmzGqD_childItem_1","label":"gg90ebmzGqD_childItem_1","default":"<p>Will ThePhotoStick® Omni X work with my device?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg90ebmzGqD_childItem_2","label":"gg90ebmzGqD_childItem_2","default":"<p>How many photos can I store on ThePhotoStick® Omni x?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg90ebmzGqD_childItem_3","label":"gg90ebmzGqD_childItem_3","default":"<p>What photo and video file types can ThePhotoStick® Omni X detect?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg90ebmzGqD_childItem_4","label":"gg90ebmzGqD_childItem_4","default":"<p>Can I use ThePhotoStick® Omni X as an ongoing backup solution?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg90ebmzGqD_childItem_5","label":"gg90ebmzGqD_childItem_5","default":"<p>Does ThePhotoStick® Omni X come with tech support?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg90ebmzGqD_childItem_6","label":"gg90ebmzGqD_childItem_6","default":"<p>How does the 30-day money-back guarantee work?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbWKzOwGnh_text","label":"ggbWKzOwGnh_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni X is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni X to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni X is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!</span><br><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">Check out our </span><a href=\"https://www.manula.com/manuals/product-support/thephotostick-omni-official-user-guide/4/en/topic/overview\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\"><u>User Guide</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\"> for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni X. We also offer live customer support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeM67yhadI_text","label":"ggeM67yhadI_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">ThePhotoStick Omni X works with all modern computers, smartphones, and tablets right out of the box.</span><br><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">It's compatible with the following Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and Later</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and Later</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">- Android: 8.0 and Later</span><br><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">For more up-to-date information regarding ThePhotoStick compatibility, we recommend viewing our </span><a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/support-system-requirements\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\"><u>System Requirements</u></span></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\"> page.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJZp62fynD_text","label":"ggJZp62fynD_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">Approximate Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick Omni X:</span><br><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">32GB - 12,800 photos</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">64GB - 25,600 photos</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">128GB - 51,200 photos</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">256GB - 102,400 photos</span><br><br><i>*Please note that storage capacity per GB listed above is approximate, and exact storage amounts vary depending on file type and size. For more in-depth information regarding ThePhotoStick Omni X, check out our </i><a href=\"https://www.manula.com/manuals/product-support/thephotostick-omni-official-user-guide/4/en/topic/overview\" target=\"_blank\"><i><u>Official User Guide</u></i></a><i>.</i></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsFp9atDpT_text","label":"ggsFp9atDpT_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">Nearly all of them! It saves your standard JPEG, HEIC, PNG, GIF, MOV, and MP4, but ThePhotoStick Omni X can now protect your contacts, documents, and audio files. It saves a vast array of file types, as listed below:</span><br><br><strong>PHOTO EXTENSIONS:</strong><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">JPEG (*.jpg;*.jpeg;*.jpe;*.jfif)</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">HEIC (*.heic, *.heics, *.heif, *.heifs, *.avci, *.avcs)</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">GIF (*.gif)</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">PNG (*.png)BMP (*.bmp;*.rle;*.dib)</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">TIFF (*.tif,*.tiff)ICO (*.ico)</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">Camera Raw (*.crw, *.nef, *.raf, *.orf, *.mrw, *.dcr, *.mos, *.raw, *.pef, *.srf, *.dng, *.x3f, *.cr2, *.erf, *.sr2, *.kdc, *.mfw, *.mef, *.arw, *.nrw, *.rw2, *.rwl, *.iiq, *.3fr, *.srw) Photoshop (*.psd, *.pdd, *.pdp, *.pse, *.eps)</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">PICT File (*.PCT, *.PICT)</span><br><br><strong>VIDEO EXTENSIONS:</strong><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">MOV (*.mov, *.qt, *.hevc)</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">MPEG4 (*.mp4, *.mpeg4, *.m4v, *.h264)</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">AVI (*.avi)</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">WMV (*.wmv)</span><br><br><strong>OTHER EXTENSIONS:</strong><br>Documents (*.doc, *.pdf)</p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">Audio (*.mp3, *.wav)</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">Contacts (*.vcf)</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2IBlvQ_lT_text","label":"gg2IBlvQ_lT_text","default":"<p>Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people use ThePhotoStick Omni X&nbsp;for&nbsp;weekly backups to make sure they are continually protecting their memories.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqVAyfJUad_text","label":"ggqVAyfJUad_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">Of course! Visit our website, thephotostick.com, and click the gray circle near the bottom right corner of the page to begin chatting with a member of our Support Team.</span><br><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">Live Chat available Monday-Saturday, 8am-8pm PST</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gggJBjmCNqS_text","label":"gggJBjmCNqS_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you're not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick, our team is here to assist you with a return. We want you to be happy!</span><br><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(54,54,54);\">If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please get in touch with us&nbsp;at returns@thephotostick.com, and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund. For more information regarding our return process, check out our Returns and Refunds page.</span></p>"}],
